                                                "sense_id": "2bb18036-c44d-34cc-9707-a4489738e5e0",
                                                "text": "Thomas Fraser (1841–1920) isolated the alkaloid eserine and made the important discovery that another alkaloid, atropine, blocked some of eserine’s actions."
